{{- /* chezmoi:modify-template */ -}}
{{- /*
Merge the Claude Code preferences from .chezmoidata/agents.yaml into
~/.claude/settings.json.

Claude Code writes its own keys here (/model, /effort, plugin installs, auto
mode). Only the keys in agents.yaml are owned by the repo. permissions and
autoMode stay machine-local: they grow per machine and can hold
work-specific text. Removing a key from agents.yaml does not remove it from
the machine.

When every managed key already holds its value, the current file is returned
byte for byte, so Claude Code's own formatting and additions never show up
as drift. Only a real difference triggers a rewrite, written with two-space
indentation and sorted keys.
*/ -}}
{{- $current := dict -}}
{{- if .chezmoi.stdin -}}{{- $current = .chezmoi.stdin | fromJson -}}{{- end -}}
{{- $merged := mergeOverwrite (deepCopy $current) (deepCopy .agents.claude.settings) -}}
{{- if eq (toJson $current) (toJson $merged) -}}
{{-     .chezmoi.stdin -}}
{{- else -}}
{{-     $merged | toPrettyJson "  " -}}
{{- end -}}
